was paid to us in cash at the closing of the Paradigm Divestiture and $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--PaymentsToAcquireEquityMethodInvestments_pn5n6_c20260227__20260227__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--ParadigmSpineGmbhMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--CoflexCoFixAgreementMember_zHpUO8opfi31" title="Aggregate purchase price in cash"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireEquityMethodInvestments" contextRef="From2026-02-272026-02-27_custom_ParadigmSpineGmbhMember_custom_CoflexCoFixAgreementMember" id="Fact000766" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million of which was paid to us on February 27, 2026 in settlement
